@startuml
title Telemetry Downlink Pipeline
participant "Spacecraft FDS Model" as FDS
participant "Simulated Link" as Link
participant "DSN Receiver" as Receiver
participant "Frame Validator" as Validator
participant "Telemetry Decoder" as Decoder
database "Raw Archive" as Raw
database "Engineering Archive" as Eng
participant "Console/Alarms" as UI
FDS -> Link : emit telemetry frame
Link -> Receiver : deliver after delay/loss model
Receiver -> Validator : raw frame + link metrics
Validator -> Raw : preserve raw input
Validator -> Decoder : valid frame + provenance
Decoder -> Eng : decoded values + dictionary version
Decoder -> UI : telemetry event
UI -> UI : evaluate thresholds and quality
@enduml
